---
source: crates/qrec-core/src/keymap.rs
expression: cheat_sheet(&map)
---
Record
  r                     Toggle record                 record.toggle
  o                     Record over selection         record.over
  d                     Discard last take             take.discard-last
  Esc                   Cancel recording              cancel

Playback
  Space                 Play / pause                  play.toggle
  j                     Shuttle reverse               shuttle.reverse
  k                     Shuttle stop                  shuttle.stop
  l                     Shuttle forward               shuttle.forward
  ←                     Seek to previous frame        seek.prev-frame
  →                     Seek to next frame            seek.next-frame
  Shift+←               Seek back 1 s                 seek.back
  Shift+→               Seek forward 1 s              seek.forward
  ↑                     Seek to previous edit point   seek.prev-edit
  ↓                     Seek to next edit point       seek.next-edit
  Home                  Seek to timeline start        seek.start
  End                   Seek to timeline end          seek.end

Edit
  ,                     Select previous clip          select.prev
  .                     Select next clip              select.next
  <                     Move selection left           clip.move-left
  >                     Move selection right          clip.move-right
  s                     Split clip                    clip.split
  [                     Trim start to playhead        clip.trim-start
  ]                     Trim end to playhead          clip.trim-end
  Alt+[                 Nudge start edge 1 frame      clip.nudge-start
  Alt+]                 Nudge end edge 1 frame        clip.nudge-end
  Alt+{                 Nudge start edge 10 frames    clip.nudge-start-10
  Alt+}                 Nudge end edge 10 frames      clip.nudge-end-10
  Del  x  Backspace     Remove clips                  clip.remove
  x                     Autocut                       autocut.run
  Shift+C               Autocut settings and preview  autocut.preview
  Ctrl+Z                Undo                          history.undo
  Ctrl+Shift+Z  Ctrl+Y  Redo                          history.redo
  Ctrl+A                Select all                    select.all

Output
  f                     Save frame as PNG             frame.save
  Ctrl+E                Export…                       export

View
  =                     Zoom timeline in              zoom.in
  -                     Zoom timeline out             zoom.out
  \                     Zoom to fit                   zoom.fit
  z                     Zoom to selection             zoom.selection
  n                     Toggle snapping               snapping.toggle
  Tab                   Switch Live / Program         canvas.mode
  b                     Toggle bin                    bin.toggle
  ?                     Keyboard shortcuts            keys.help
  Ctrl+K  :             Command palette               palette.open
  Ctrl+,                Settings                      settings.open
  F6                    Focus next region             region.next
  Shift+F6              Focus previous region         region.prev
  Ctrl+Q                Quit                          app.quit

Canvas
  ←                     Nudge layer left 1 px         layer.nudge-left
  →                     Nudge layer right 1 px        layer.nudge-right
  ↑                     Nudge layer up 1 px           layer.nudge-up
  ↓                     Nudge layer down 1 px         layer.nudge-down
  Shift+←               Nudge layer left 10 px        layer.nudge-left-10
  Shift+→               Nudge layer right 10 px       layer.nudge-right-10
  Shift+↑               Nudge layer up 10 px          layer.nudge-up-10
  Shift+↓               Nudge layer down 10 px        layer.nudge-down-10

Problems
  x is bound to clip.remove and autocut.run in global; neither runs until keys.toml changes one
  keys.toml: unknown binding `nope` (`qrec keys` lists the ids)
